# Machine-local launchers. run_tune.cmd and run_final.cmd in the repo use
# whatever `python` is on PATH, which a scheduled task running as SYSTEM
# does not have. Each machine therefore pins its own interpreter into a
# *_local.cmd and points its task at that, instead of editing the tracked
# file and dirtying the working tree before every pull.
*_local.cmd
